## Live Regions

### Status Messages
```php
<!-- For dynamic status updates -->
<div
    class="status-message"
    role="status"
    aria-live="polite"
    aria-atomic="true"
>
    <!-- Updated via JavaScript -->
</div>

<!-- For urgent alerts -->
<div
    class="alert-message"
    role="alert"
    aria-live="assertive"
>
    <!-- Updated via JavaScript -->
</div>
```

```javascript
// Update status
const updateStatus = ( message ) => {
    const statusRegion = document.querySelector( '[role="status"]' );
    statusRegion.textContent = message;
};

// Show alert
const showAlert = ( message ) => {
    const alertRegion = document.querySelector( '[role="alert"]' );
    alertRegion.textContent = message;
};
```

## Testing Checklist

### Keyboard Testing
- [ ] All interactive elements reachable with Tab
- [ ] Logical tab order
- [ ] Focus visible on all elements
- [ ] Enter/Space activates buttons and links
- [ ] Escape closes modals/dropdowns
- [ ] Arrow keys navigate menus/tabs

### Screen Reader Testing
- [ ] Page title announces correctly
- [ ] Headings create logical outline
- [ ] Images have appropriate alt text
- [ ] Links have descriptive text
- [ ] Forms have proper labels
- [ ] Error messages announced
- [ ] Dynamic content updates announced

### Visual Testing
- [ ] Color contrast passes WCAG AA
- [ ] Focus indicators visible
- [ ] Text readable at 200% zoom
- [ ] Content reflows at narrow widths
- [ ] No horizontal scrolling at 320px
- [ ] Reduced motion preference respected
